    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Crestro is a four-seat see saw in Lemon Green, with two parallel beams on one shared pivot. Each beam has a moulded seat with a handle loop at both ends, so four children can ride at once, two facing two. Riders have to time their pushes with the child opposite, which builds concentration and confidence. Emotional intelligence is the third skill on its list. Crestro needs only 6'7\" x 4'3\" of ground and a safe play area of 12'7\" x 10'3\". That makes it easy to add to a society play area or a school ground next to bigger structures. It sits in the Pinnacle series of our NexLev range. The galvanised pipe and roto-moulded seats are covered for 3 years, with 1 year on bearings and spare parts. Tell us how many see saws your ground needs."
     }
    ]
   }
